<title>USA: CBOE seat sells for record $700,000.</title>
<headline>CBOE seat sells for record $700,000.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A seat at the Chicago Board Options Exchange sold Friday for a record $700,000, the exchange said.</p>
<p>The previous record of $675,100 was set on May 16.</p>
<p>The current bid/ask for a seat is $630,000/$822,000.</p>
<p>A week ago, the exchange received a licence from Dow Jones &amp; Co to trade options on the widely followed Dow Jones Industrial Average.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
